# 🔑 Gemini API Configuration
# Get your FREE API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Free tier includes: 1,500 requests/day, 1M tokens/month
# Note: Vite requires environment variables to start with VITE_ to be accessible in the browser

VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_vite_gemini_api_key_here
# Replace 'your_api_key_here' with your actual API key from Google AI Studio
# Example: VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyAbc123...